== Walkthrough ==

You say, 'Hail, Gozzrem'

: Gozzrem says 'Greetings Ayama . If you seek wisdom or the arcane I have tasks in the halls of testing you may complete to gain what you seek. 

You say, 'I seek wisdom'

: Gozzrem says 'Wisdom can be gleaned from battle and that is what I wish you to do. Battle in the halls of testing may give you a different outlook on life. Which do you seek, the short battle or the long? 

You say, 'I seek the short battle'

: Gozzrem says 'For the shortest time in the halls, seek out a [[Platinum Tear]] held by the cursed one [[Dozekar the Cursed]], a [[Platinum Symbol]], a [[Silver Symbol]] and an [[Emerald Symbol]] as green as the forests. If you are able to return these to me I will reward you with a simple idol of the white dragons.

